  "content": "<p><span><strong>要讓它正常運作：<br></strong></span><span>- 你可以像往常一樣使用 Optifine<br>或<br></span><span>- 在 Fabric 上，你需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a> <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; （以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a> 作為依賴）<br>...然後將此資源包放入 <em>resourcepacks</em> 資料夾</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qzm7rdw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"603\" height=\"339\"><br>使用此資源包後，蜘蛛的腿部會呈現更自然的樣貌。<br></span></p>",
